      "contribution": "Exact angular-integration proof, rational profile reconstruction and standard-library certificate checker for the in-model bound kappa* >= 1.86637 (Section 3.3, supplement/exact_certificate). Scope: model feasibility only, not optimality or a bound on t(n).",
